  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 926da602-d761-4ba0-8211-9550cb929ba6
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • November 2024 achieved highest sales at 118,448, showing strong holiday performance
        • February 2021 recorded lowest sales at 4,520, indicating seasonal weakness
        • November-December periods consistently outperform other months across all years
        • 2024 shows stronger monthly figures compared to earlier years

        Recommendations:
        • Increase inventory and marketing spend during Nov-Dec holiday periods
        • Develop targeted campaigns for low-performing months like February
        • Leverage 2024 growth momentum with expanded product offerings
